he current register file applies an x0/WB/stored-word priority mux before forward_unit applies a second EX/MEM/register-file selector. This serial operand selection is unnecessary: the four authoritative sources can be selected together. Scratch timing reproduced the champion and found competing branch, divider and decode-forwarding paths, so shortening one branch comparator alone was insufficient. This proposal instead removes a real mux boundary from both decode operand buses without adding arithmetic, state, or execution cycles. \nls: cannot access 'cores/bench/worktrees': No such file or directory\n","exit_code":2,"status":"failed"}}
