ication datapaths\\non their current single-cycle path. Remove all synthesizable / and %\\nlogic from the core's instantiated ALU. The divider captures the actual\\nforwarded source values once and computes unsigned magnitudes using\\nfour explicitly unrolled restoring binary division steps per clock,\\nwith quotient and remainder registered between groups. Eight groups\\nproduce all 32 quotient bits. Capture ope\n…[83271 of 86343 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:cc06fd7b08e62a3b]…\ne-effect assertion. Adapt obsolete early-source\\nexpectations to require valid registered EX division with exact raw\\noperands. Cover divisions after taken controls and dependent\\nbyte/halfword/word loads, consecutive DIV/REM, multiply transitions,\\nlaunch behind stalled older stores and delayed result acceptance.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"improvement\", \"fitness\": 174.53, \"delta_pct\": 13.24, \"vs_baseline\": 1340.02, \"fmax_mhz\": 83.321, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4773913, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 4592, \"ff\": 1073, \"seeds\": [85.334, 83.321, 83.321], \"perturbations\": [[0, 85.334, 9], [1, 83.321, 14], [2, 83.321, 14]], \"lutram\": 40, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.ctrl.alu_op_4_s0\", \"to\": \"dmem_1_dmem_1_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -6.719, \"arrival_ns\": 17.013, \"logic_cells\": 9, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 9, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-04T17:24:06.146290Z\", \"slot\": 1, \"round_id\": 7}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
