uct the exact 32-bit result.\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: |\n      Retain all architectural, arithmetic and ten-cycle progress checks.\n      Update bundle observers and source lists; force correct and wrong\n      carry guesses for dependent consumers using either/both raw source\n      tags, unused tags and x0. Cover immediate and AUIPC input repair,\n      branch/JALR, load/store, consecutive producers, MUL/DIV/REM, skid\n      holds, bus stalls, reset and masked training. Assert one repair\n      cycle, held consumer metadata, exact RVFI operands/PC/data/order,\n      no speculative launch/redirect/store, exactly-once effects, and\n      the ten-cycle gap for a repaired consumer that is DIV/REM.\n''')\nprint('Revised hypothesis written:',p)\nPY\"", "aggregated_output": "Revised hypothesis written: cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261004-003-r14s2.yaml\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_41","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"python - <<'PY'\nimport json,yaml,jsonschema\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261004-003-r14s2.yaml')\nd=yaml.safe_load(p.read_text());jsonschema.validate(d,json.loads(Path('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json').read_text()))\nassert d['id']=='hyp-20261004-003-r14s2' and d['category']=='predictor'\nassert type(d['expected_impact']['fitness_delta_pct']) is int and -50<=d['expected_impact']['fitness_delta_pct']<=50\nprint('Updated hypothesis passes schema validation.')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
